  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ADB Clean Energy Financing Partnership  Facility - ADB Clean Energy 2012-14</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">ADB Clean Energy Financing Partnership  Facility</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">CEFs huvudsakliga m&#xe5;l &#xe4;r att finansiera projekt inom &quot;ren Energi&quot;,  dvs. f&#xf6;rnybart, energieff, och tillg&#xe5;ng till energi. Fonden  finansierar &#xe4;ven pilotprojekt, utveckling av policy,                  finansieringsmetoder etc. f&#xf6;r att stimulere ren energi.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Clean Energy Fund is part of ADB Clean Energy Financing Partnership  Facility. Main objective to finance projects in clean energy, major demonstration projects, policy development and mode of fundings.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Clean Energy Financing Partnership Facility (CEFPF) was established in 2007 to help improve energy security in Developing Member Countries (DMCs) and decrease the rate of climate change. It will do this by financing the deployment of new, more efficient and less polluting supply and end-use technologies, through either grant or non-grant resources. The CEFPF is composed of the Clean Energy Fund (CEF), the Asian Clean Energy Fund (ACEF), the Carbon Capture and Storage Fund (CCSF) and the Canadian Climate Fund for the Private Sector in Asia (CFPS).</narrative>
  </description>
